:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/structure/container"><col layout="plain" variations="[col-lg-8,mx-auto]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/structure/container"><hero imagePath="/content/sites/acpl/assets/story-3.jpg" altText="Westmoreland Athletic cruise past Marshall Town in Matchweek 15" variations="[img-fluid,rounded,mb-4]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/content/image"/><lead variations="[lead,mb-4]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/content/text" text="Westmoreland Athletic made it a Saturday to forget for Marshall Town, winning 4-1 in front of 9,781."/><p0 variations="[mb-3]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/content/text" text="Westmoreland Athletic claimed a 4-1 win over Marshall Town in front of 9,781 at Founders Field, a result that keeps the Matchweek 15 talking points coming."/><p1 variations="[mb-3]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/content/text" text="The goals came from Theo Park (17&#39;), Marco Rahman (27&#39;), Hugh Osei (36&#39;), Hakim Ndiaye (37&#39;) and Patrice Reid (50&#39;)."/><p2 variations="[mb-3]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/content/text" text="The hosts saw 64% of the ball, registering 11 shots to the visitors&#39; 15, and referee M. Fenton kept the game flowing (9°C, light rain)."/><p3 variations="[mb-3]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/content/text" text="Westmoreland Athletic will feel the scoreline was a fair reflection of the contest, while Marshall Town head home knowing the margins at this level remain unforgiving."/><p4 variations="[mb-3]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/content/text" text="Attention now turns to the next round of fixtures, with both camps expected to rotate as the schedule tightens."/><back href="/content/sites/acpl/stories.html" variations="[btn,btn-outline-primary,btn-sm,mt-3]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/content/link" text="← Back to all stories"/><mc href="/content/sites/acpl/matches/1352.html" variations="[btn,btn-primary,btn-sm,mt-3,ms-2]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/content/link" text="Match centre →"/></col></row></wrap><related layout="plain" variations="[container,my-5,pt-4,border-top]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/structure/container"><rh variations="[section-heading,mb-4]" headingText="Related Stories" headingType="h2" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/content/heading"/><rl layout="default" kes:datasource="related-stories" story="mw15-westmoreland-marshall" limit="3" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="/libs/kestros/commons/components/lists/card-list"/></related></main>
